Subject: [PATCH 37/50] Keep image channel names and color interpretations valid

Consolidate the related implementation, regression tests, and build
updates listed below. Full original messages and authorship are retained
in HISTORY.

Original-Commit: 03b63ea80c2f3642b48a71df3f15f358baaa7f5e
Original-Commit: 6672305d3b0e73877d36fb432c8dc9041d758cb4

